{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412160","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041216001:1":{"text":"너희가 땅거미 숲 밖에서 로잔을 정말 많이 도와줬다지? 착하구나.","source_cn":"好孩子，真没想到，你们在薄暮丛林外帮了洛桑那么多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2049944AA916F587","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041216002:1":{"text":"그 아이가 너희에게 폐를 끼치지는 않았니?","source_cn":"那个兔小子没给你们惹麻烦吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7AECFC0273C4491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041216003:1":{"text":"그럼요! 할머니, 걱정 마세요. 마스터에게는 식은 죽 먹기 같은 일이라 쉽게 해결할 수 있었어요!","source_cn":"当然有！不过婆婆你放心，那些事对主人来说，都是小菜一碟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A6FC60BCDF78B52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041216004:1":{"text":"그럼 다행이구나!","source_cn":"哦！那就好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE480D1B7221C6AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041216005:1":{"text":"너희와 같은 친구를 사귀었다니, 그 아이의 이번 여행이 헛걸음은 아니게 된 셈이지. 후후.","source_cn":"能交到你们这样的朋友，他这一趟游历也算是不虚此行了，呵呵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C91076740A32186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_